    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"In the summer of 1990, funding was available to design and implement two portable seismic arrays for the volcano program. The approach was based on Lee et al. (1989). Several contracts were awarded to commercial companies to design and implement various components needed to build the portable arrays. T le purpose of this report to present the software modules for data conversion purposes - DR2ST/ST2DR, GRM2ST/ST2GRM, PCEQ2ST/PCQ2ST, SEGY2ST, IOJISDS, and ICLWRSDS, and two miscellaneous modules - PLT.PMTN, and SPILPLFL - in detail as submitted by the contractors.\"",
            "type": "abstract",
